From 90014d6223e81c459a73011f7cff147f66f844a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:54:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): preserve machined walls and cavities through side
 turns

Retain box stock and swept-tool geometry through setup turns. Read separate
material intervals for stock, fixtures, and later cuts. Refuse unreadable
geometry and excessive work by name. Keep the field engine refusal.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1805
